1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,079
This world's a mix of colors and blue

4
00:00:27,079 --> 00:00:30,079
Truth and falsehood blur our eyes

5
00:00:30,079 --> 00:00:33,100
Use your heart to truly see

6
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,079
Find the truth is not far away

7
00:00:36,079 --> 00:00:37,500
Hey you could do better

8
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,100
True and false

9
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:42,100
Can't escape this mental haze

10
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:45,079
Take along all your courage

11
00:00:45,079 --> 00:00:48,240
Maybe then you'll save this world

12
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,500
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:59,500
Runaway Princess

14
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:26,540
Lorena

15
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:45,980
Princess, please accept the communication request

16
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:48,740
How many times have I said it

17
00:01:48,819 --> 00:01:50,219
A computer is a computer

18
00:01:50,219 --> 00:01:52,359
Don't appear before me in my mother's likeness

19
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:53,819
I'm sorry, miss

20
00:01:53,819 --> 00:01:56,700
The master requires that the communication feed in this room

21
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:59,439
must appear as Madam Ye's hologram

22
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:02,579
Now I'll block the video signal

23
00:02:02,579 --> 00:02:04,760
Queen

24
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,120
What else do you want to say

25
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:08,460
If you won't help me leave here, forget it

26
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:09,900
So you want to stop me

27
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:12,939
Leaving the castle is strictly forbidden by your father

28
00:02:12,939 --> 00:02:15,900
His orders take top priority

29
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,500
Hmph, top priority? Hahaha

30
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:21,439
If you still acknowledge yourself as the carrier of my mother's personality

31
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:23,139
then don't refuse me

32
00:02:23,139 --> 00:02:26,199
I believe if Mother were still alive

33
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:28,439
she would agree with my actions

34
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:31,699
According to the data in my database

35
00:02:31,699 --> 00:02:34,000
Madam Ye would not approve of your behavior

36
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:38,219
Then if the reason I run away from home is

37
00:02:38,219 --> 00:02:41,400
to test whether Father still loves me?

38
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,300
After database analysis

39
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:45,539
Your father cares about you very much

40
00:02:45,539 --> 00:02:46,900
Cares?

41
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:49,200
Caring means only providing food, clothing, and shelter

42
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,960
and not letting me contact the outside world?

43
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,360
Caring means making me every day

44
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,939
face only you bunch of

45
00:02:54,939 --> 00:02:57,159
tin toys and electronic components?

46
00:02:57,159 --> 00:02:59,000
This is what she calls caring?

47
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,599
I'd rather not have this kind of caring

48
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:03,640
Queen

49
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,920
Although I still cannot agree with you to this day

50
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,120
but your internal

51
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,819
Indeed, my mother's personality exists within me.

52
00:03:08,819 --> 00:03:10,240
So I hope

53
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:12,300
you can help me fulfill this wish.

54
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:14,300
At the same time, I promise you

55
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:16,300
my plan will never give Father

56
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,580
a reason to blame you.

57
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:22,680
If this is what you think must be done,

58
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,219
then I support your decision.

59
00:03:24,219 --> 00:03:26,620
But you only have five minutes of freedom at most.

60
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:27,780
Good luck.

61
00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:35,740
Shaker,

62
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:37,360
let's begin the operation.

63
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,180
Got it.

64
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:38,820
Dottie... Dottie.

65
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:39,560
I will definitely—

66
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:44,620
Beautiful princess,

67
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,140
I've come to welcome you.

68
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:49,140
Cast aside your sorrow and greet the dawn with me!

69
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:07,140
Start running the virus program.

70
00:04:30,139 --> 00:04:31,879
Where is Xiaoye?

71
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,699
Is she still in the room?

72
00:04:33,699 --> 00:04:35,039
Master, I'm sorry,

73
00:04:35,039 --> 00:04:36,579
Xiaoye is missing.

74
00:04:36,579 --> 00:04:38,159
What exactly happened?

75
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,439
Early this morning,

76
00:04:39,439 --> 00:04:41,159
I've been attacked by a computer virus.

77
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:43,740
The castle's security system went down for five minutes.

78
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:47,379
I think the culprit must have used that window to take Little Ye.

79
00:04:47,379 --> 00:04:49,360
Do you think we should contact the police?

80
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:51,620
Hmph! Don't mention them to me.

81
00:04:51,620 --> 00:04:54,220
If the police were any good at catching robbers,

82
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,780
my wife wouldn't have died in vain back then.

83
00:04:56,780 --> 00:04:57,819
I'm sorry.

84
00:04:57,819 --> 00:04:59,439
Forget it.

85
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:01,920
Can you trace the source of the virus?

86
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,840
For safety reasons,

87
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:07,420
we must now reorganize all the data in the database.

88
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:09,819
Temporarily, we cannot investigate the virus source.

89
00:05:09,819 --> 00:05:13,199
Your safety must also be guaranteed.

90
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:16,259
Quickly summon the best private detective in town.

91
00:05:16,259 --> 00:05:18,539
I'll wait for them in the reception room.

92
00:05:18,539 --> 00:05:26,459
Begin search.

93
00:05:26,459 --> 00:05:31,959
Strange.

94
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:34,740
The symptoms of this virus are different from what Little Ye described.

95
00:05:34,740 --> 00:05:36,819
The database is severely damaged.

96
00:05:36,819 --> 00:05:44,339
The castle!!

97
00:05:44,339 --> 00:05:51,600
Uncle, is this the client's home?

98
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,639
Yeah, Lord Ye is the wealthiest man in town.

99
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:56,759
Alright, alright, you two.

100
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:58,480
Can you please act normal?

101
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,980
We're gonna be late!

102
00:05:59,980 --> 00:06:07,080
It's like a medieval palace!

103
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,100
So over the top.

104
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,980
Wonder if it'll be like in the movies—

105
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:12,319
A white-bearded butler greeting us!

106
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:14,360
Aah! A ghost!

107
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:18,560
Ghosts don't exist in this world.

108
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,259
You're so rude!

109
00:06:20,259 --> 00:06:21,460
Showing up out of nowhere!

110
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:24,240
Don't you know scaring people can kill them?

111
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:27,120
Hawxing!

112
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,780
What are you doing here?

113
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:30,600
Someone invited me, of course.

114
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:33,660
Sorry!

115
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:35,600
Kept you all waiting.

116
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:38,260
Please follow the service bot to the meeting room.

117
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:41,120
Mr. Ye has been expecting you.

118
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:44,840
Wow! That's a huge computer!

119
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,620
What is this?

120
00:06:46,620 --> 00:06:49,660
This is my wife's intelligent electronic replica.

121
00:06:49,660 --> 00:06:51,820
An accident ten years ago...

122
00:06:51,820 --> 00:06:53,740
...took my wife's life.

123
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:54,920
All these years...

124
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:58,160
I finally, with the power of technology...

125
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,620
...brought her back to life.

126
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:02,540
Hello everyone

127
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:05,060
I am the intelligent computer, Queen.

128
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:07,020
The suspect designated it for the exchange

129
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:09,460
Where is Miss Ye's Sea Princess statue?

130
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:10,980
The statue is stored in the castle

131
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:12,420
in the highest piano room

132
00:07:12,420 --> 00:07:14,660
It can, through different melodies,

133
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:16,900
sense the player's emotions

134
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:18,260
and thus emit

135
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:19,640
lights of different colors

136
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,420
The Sea Princess statue

137
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:23,180
is the Ye family heirloom

138
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:25,800
Truly magical, huh

139
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,620
No wonder the criminal wants it

140
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:28,439
Lord Ye

141
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:31,100
Can you let me connect to the Queen's main database?

142
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:33,180
Let me analyze the data

143
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:34,459
and carry out the investigation

144
00:07:34,459 --> 00:07:36,100
Please forgive me, I refuse

145
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:38,139
because my database contains

146
00:07:38,139 --> 00:07:40,519
a large number of confidential Ye family documents

147
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:41,899
No, Hawxing

148
00:07:41,899 --> 00:07:43,340
You can do that

149
00:07:43,340 --> 00:07:45,579
The Queen and I will be present to supervise

150
00:07:45,579 --> 00:07:46,100
Of course

151
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,280
But could you let them?

152
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:49,300
First, get out of this room.

153
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:51,920
Someone among them is way too loud.

154
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,199
What did you say?

155
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:55,100
Just admit you want to show off.

156
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:57,120
Why are you scolding me in such a roundabout way?!

157
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,800
Really noisy.

158
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,560
Night City Master

159
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,319
Can we go check out the princess's room?

160
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,819
Maybe there's a clue.

161
00:08:02,819 --> 00:08:11,600
Locky

162
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,780
Come on, let's find clues together!

163
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:15,540
What's easy to find?

164
00:08:15,540 --> 00:08:16,699
Absolutely nothing.

165
00:08:16,699 --> 00:08:18,379
Uncle's so tricky.

166
00:08:18,379 --> 00:08:19,540
Said they're going out to make a call.

167
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:21,180
Have the police provide covert backup.

168
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:23,079
Just leave us here wasting time.

169
00:08:23,079 --> 00:08:24,899
Waste of time.

170
00:08:24,899 --> 00:08:26,360
Of course.

171
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,080
What clues could there be?

172
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,240
If there's a clue

173
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:32,159
That rich man's robot already found it long ago.

174
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:33,240
Forget it.

175
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,139
Just take a casual look.

176
00:08:34,139 --> 00:08:36,120
When Inspector Sima gets back, just say nothing new was found.

177
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:40,539
Huh? A rag doll?

178
00:08:40,539 --> 00:08:41,700
Hey hey hey.

179
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:42,240
Jingjing.

180
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,800
Don't treat this place like your own home.

181
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,519
Or that poker face

182
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:47,860
will say we messed up the crime scene again.

183
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,920
Ouch.

184
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:52,100
Ow ow ow ow ow!

185
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:53,700
It hurts so much!

186
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:54,480
What's this?

187
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:59,480
[Email login: incorrect password]

188
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:05,019
Dang it! I should've learned more about computers.

189
00:09:05,019 --> 00:09:07,060
Locky, what are you playing with?

190
00:09:08,019 --> 00:09:12,060
[Logging in...]

191
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:15,899
Never thought they'd use music as the password.

192
00:09:15,899 --> 00:09:24,379
High Tower Princess.

193
00:09:24,379 --> 00:09:25,699
Is the gift to your liking?

194
00:09:25,699 --> 00:09:27,720
Wishing you all the best with your escape plan. [P.S. Please destroy this letter before you leave. —Nintendough]

195
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,019
Awesome!

196
00:09:29,019 --> 00:09:30,840
Now everything makes sense.

197
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,039
What makes sense?

198
00:09:32,039 --> 00:09:33,439
Inspector Sima.

199
00:09:33,439 --> 00:09:35,879
I found the best clue!

200
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:37,360
We've totally got this this time.

201
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:39,779
Just wait and see Hawxing embarrass himself, hahaha

202
00:09:39,779 --> 00:09:42,220
Detective Chen

203
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:44,019
Please send it to the main computer room

204
00:09:44,019 --> 00:09:45,939
A little accident happened here

205
00:10:14,019 --> 00:10:19,259
Tomorrow, wave to me at the horizon

206
00:10:19,259 --> 00:10:22,919
Every day is just sunrise and sunset

207
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:26,879
Turning into time, imagining more

208
00:10:26,879 --> 00:10:31,939
Looking forward to every second and every moment in life

209
00:10:31,939 --> 00:10:38,659
My bright eyes are sparkling

210
00:10:38,659 --> 00:10:42,019
A smile facing the sunlight

211
00:10:42,019 --> 00:10:47,259
Stepping quietly at the crossroads of Qian'an's home